It's seven o'clock. It's half past three.

50
00:02:30.814 --> 00:02:31.862
Your turn!

51
00:02:35.362 --> 00:02:38.467
It's seven o'clock. It's half past three.

52
00:02:39.483 --> 00:02:40.891
